  "body": "## What's Changed\n* ci: pin k3s images to avoid update.k3s.io lookups by @alpeb in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15761\n* fix(inject): inherit beta native sidecar annotation from namespace by @spicysharkco in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15734\n* build: keep apko outputs out of the repo root by @alpeb in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15766\n* chore: bump k8s testing ref to 1.37 by @raykroeker in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15740\n* proxy: v2.373.0 by @l5d-bot in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15768\n* build(deps): bump node-forge from 1.4.0 to 1.4.3 in /web/app by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15763\n* ci: fix flaky policy tests by @toidiu in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15732\n* chore: bump dev image to v55. by @toidiu in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15775\n* chore: migrate stale from app to action by @raykroeker in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15776\n* proxy: v2.374.0 by @l5d-bot in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15781\n\n## New Contributors\n* @spicysharkco made their first contribution in https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/pull/15734\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linkerd/linkerd2/compare/edge-26.11.1...edge-26.11.2",
